DTSTAMP:20261114T015449Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270415
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270416
SUMMARY:Jackie Robinson breaks baseball's color barrier — 80th anniversar
 y
DESCRIPTION:Jackie Robinson debuted at first base for the Brooklyn Dodger
 s\, becoming the first Black player in the modern major leagues.\n\nhttp
 s://baseballhall.org/hall-of-famers/robinson-jackie
URL:https://baseballhall.org/hall-of-famers/robinson-jackie
CATEGORIES:anniversary
END:VEVENT
