DTSTAMP:20261114T015449Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270426
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270427
SUMMARY:Studio 54 opens — 50th anniversary
DESCRIPTION:The Midtown discotheque opened and instantly became the epice
 nter of celebrity nightlife and disco excess.\n\nhttps://www.britannica.
 com/topic/Studio-54
URL:https://www.britannica.com/topic/Studio-54
