SUMMARY:Executive budget for fiscal 2028
DESCRIPTION:The mayor's revised budget\, due under Charter section 249\, 
 updated for whatever Albany did on April 1.\n\nhttps://codelibrary.amleg
 al.com/codes/newyorkcity/latest/NYCcharter/0-0-0-1
