DTSTAMP:20261114T015449Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270613
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270614
SUMMARY:Lindbergh gets a ticker-tape hero's welcome — 100th anniversary
DESCRIPTION:Millions lined Broadway for a ticker-tape parade honoring Cha
 rles Lindbergh after his solo flight across the Atlantic.\n\nhttps://www
 .britannica.com/biography/Charles-Lindbergh
URL:https://www.britannica.com/biography/Charles-Lindbergh
CATEGORIES:anniversary
END:VEVENT
