DTSTAMP:20261114T015449Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20271113
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20271114
SUMMARY:Times Square is reborn — 30th anniversary
DESCRIPTION:Disney's The Lion King opened at the restored New Amsterdam T
 heatre\, symbolizing the transformation of a once-seedy Times Square int
 o a family tourist mecca.\n\nhttps://www.mcny.org/
URL:https://www.mcny.org/
CATEGORIES:anniversary
END:VEVENT
