DTSTAMP:20261114T015449Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20271213
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20271214
SUMMARY:Delmonico's opens — 200th anniversary
DESCRIPTION:The Swiss-born Delmonico brothers opened a small café on Will
 iam Street that grew into America's pioneering fine-dining restaurant.\n
